{"id":"wb-7-498","name":"乌什喀特古城遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"乌什喀特古城遗址","text":"乌什喀特古城遗址，又称玉奇喀特古城，位于新疆维吾尔自治区阿克苏地区新和县玉奇喀特镇古城社区，原玉奇喀特村西北1.5公里。\n1928年时称于什加提，即维吾尔语“三重城”之意。2013年3月5日，以乌什喀特古城遗址之名列入第七批全国重点文物保护单位（古遗址）。此处遗址被认为是西域都护府的驻地它乾城。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B9%8C%E4%BB%80%E5%96%80%E7%89%B9%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":95220261,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95220261","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/855b08cad5ef7b1af5c3bbc6.jpg","title":"乌什喀特古城遗址.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%B9%8C%E4%BB%80%E5%96%80%E7%89%B9%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c6/%E4%B9%8C%E4%BB%80%E5%96%80%E7%89%B9%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"HaziiDozen","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​乌什喀特古城遗址","width":320,"height":213}}